{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2022-02-07 16:50:00', 'title': 'PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT ROLES CHANGING IN ROYCE PREMIER FUND', 'text': "NEW YORK, FEB. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EFFECTIVE 4/1/22, STEVEN MCBOYLE AND LAUREN ROMEO, CFA® WILL BECOME CO-LEAD PORTFOLIO MANAGERS ON ROYCE PREMIER FUND, WHERE THEY HAVE BEEN PORTFOLIO MANAGERS SINCE 2016. EACH HAS BEEN INVOLVED IN THE FUND'S MANAGEMENT SINCE 2014 AND 2006, RESPECTIVELY."}